Package: mapAI
Title: Positional Accuracy Improvement for Geospatial Vector and Raster Data
Version: 1.0.0
Authors@R: 
    person(given = "Konstantinos",
           family = "Vantas",
           role = c("aut", "cre"),
           email = "kon.vantas@gmail.com",
           comment = c(ORCID = "0000-0001-6387-8791"))
Description: A framework for Positional Accuracy Improvement (PAI) and 
             differential distortion analysis of geospatial vector and raster 
             data. It supports conformal similarity, affine, Thin Plate Spline 
             (TPS), GAM, TIN, Akima spline, and hybrid transformation models, 
             with an extensible architecture for custom machine-learning 
             methods. Integrated spatial cross-validation helps reduce spatial 
             autocorrelation and data leakage. The package also provides 
             topology-preserving vector transformation, raster rectification, 
             and deformation diagnostics based on Tissot's indicatrices, 
             Cauchy–Green tensor invariants, and Jacobian analysis.
